  "hindi": "सीधा वक्ता विरोधियों को जीत ले; देवों को चाहने वाला देवों को न चाहने वाले पर प्रबल हो। उत्तम सहायक युद्धों में दुर्जय को जीत ले; यजमान यज्ञ न करने वाले के भोग का विभाग कर ले।",
  "english": "The honest speaker shall overcome the hostile; the one seeking the gods shall prevail over the one not seeking the gods. The good helper shall win the one hard to overcome in battles; the sacrificer shall divide the goods of the non-sacrificer.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "śaṃsaḥ taken as 'speaker' (or 'praise'); 'abhi asat' read as 'shall prevail over'. In line b the object duṣṭaram is read as the hard-to-overcome adversary or prize.",
  "confidence": "medium"
 },
